      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Tolosa-Hunt-syndrome and pseudotumor cerebri are rare syndromes accompanied by headache and ophthalmological disturbances. Pseudotumor cerebri has to be differentiated against optic nerve lesions with bilateral edema. Tolosa-Hunt-syndrome must be delimited from other painful disorders of eye motility."},
